# KSV-0014: the web Deployment's `seed-html` init container runs with a
# writable root filesystem on purpose — its only job is `cp -a`ing the image's
# baked static assets into the emptyDir the main `web` container then mounts
# read-write (see templates/web-deployment.yaml's header comment). The main
# container itself keeps readOnlyRootFilesystem: true; only this scratch
# init container is exempted.
KSV-0014
